---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<BaseLayout path="/privacy" noindex>
  <section class="section hero-copy"><div class="container narrow"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy notice' }]} /><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p>This notice explains how Threads Coaching handles personal information when you contact us. It must be reviewed and approved by the business before the site is launched.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Who is responsible for your information?</h2><p>Threads Coaching is the controller for the information you provide when you contact us. You can contact us at <a href="mailto:threadscoaching@gmail.com">threadscoaching@gmail.com</a>.</p><h2>What information we collect</h2><p>When you contact us, we may receive your name, email address, telephone number and the details you choose to share about your enquiry.</p><h2>Why we use it</h2><p>We use this information to respond to your enquiry, discuss relevant services and manage our communication with you. We do not use it for unrelated marketing without a clear lawful basis.</p><h2>Who receives it</h2><p>Your information is accessible only to people and service providers needed to respond to your enquiry and operate our website and email securely. The final published notice will identify those providers and the applicable retention periods.</p><h2>Your rights</h2><p>You may ask for access to, correction of, restriction of or deletion of your personal information where applicable. You may also complain to the UK Information Commissioner’s Office.</p><h2>Updates</h2><p>We may update this notice when our practices change. The published version will show its effective date.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
